# An unknown command typed in mixed case earns the SAME diagnostic identity as any other casing of
# the same absent callable: `params.name` is the case-folded resolution identity (`mystery`), not the
# source spelling — case-insensitive identifiers can never make the source casing the identity
# (spec/error-model.md:254-259; issue #1005). No visible name is within edit distance 2, so there is
# no `suggestion`.
MyStErY
